Package: file-organizer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Unkn0wndo3s <louis1.potevin1@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libvulkan1
Recommends: libayatana-appindicator3-1
Homepage: https://github.com/unkn0wndo3s/file-organizer
Description: Keeps the home folder tidy and searchable
 File Organizer sweeps every new download into a folder matching its type,
 then indexes the folders it manages so they can be searched instantly from
 a global Ctrl+Space shortcut.
 .
 It runs from the notification area, watches the managed folders so the index
 follows what happens on disk, and can start with the user's session.
